    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/6fb6e473c3940216e2bf96f141f7c5f6.avif?t=1749311589\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span><br>As a member of the <strong>Iron Hunters</strong> organization, it is your mission  to hunt down criminals and mercenaries hidden on dangerous planets. While you search for your objective, you must fight against the hostile fauna of the place and prepare for the final challenge.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies and\u00a0choose weapons and skills to create synergies and powerful mecha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore different planets and face their dangerous fauna</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, parts and power-ups for your mecha permanently</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path. The greater the risk, the greater the rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/6fb6e473c3940216e2bf96f141f7c5f6.avif?t=1749311589\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span><br>As a member of the <strong>Iron Hunters</strong> organization, it is your mission  to hunt down criminals and mercenaries hidden on dangerous planets. While you search for your objective, you must fight against the hostile fauna of the place and prepare for the final challenge.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies and\u00a0choose weapons and skills to create synergies and powerful mecha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/1ba4571081a6af45920687f59a586214.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore different planets and face their dangerous fauna</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/4fec5796c54bd4f98bfa79aa5df3bf80.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, parts and power-ups for your mecha permanently</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/f6a63fc02c1479abd1110223aa524abf.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path. The greater the risk, the greater the rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.poster.avif?t=1749311589\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.webm?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/75235e3f0587bd1b3c12bfea497af51f.mp4?t=1749311589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
